* AP2112K-3.3 behavioral LDO (DC, startup, dropout, enable, load steps)
.subckt AP2112K_33 VIN EN VSS VOUT PARAMS: Vset=3.3 Rdo=0.42 Gm=30 Ilim=0.8 Iq=55u
Ren   EN VSS 3Meg
* smooth enable, threshold between VIL=0.4 and VIH=1.5
Ben   en_ok VSS V = 1/(1+exp(-(V(EN,VSS)-0.95)/0.05))
* pass element: error-amp Gm, limited by Ilim and by headroom (dropout = Rdo*Iout)
Bpass VIN VOUT I = max(0, min(min(Gm*(Vset*V(en_ok,VSS)-V(VOUT,VSS)), Ilim), max(V(VIN,VOUT),0)/Rdo))
* quiescent and standby current from VIN
Biq   VIN VSS I = Iq*V(en_ok,VSS) + 10n*(1-V(en_ok,VSS))
* 60 ohm output discharge when disabled
Bdis  VOUT VSS I = (1-V(en_ok,VSS))*V(VOUT,VSS)/60
.ends
